<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-31T13:46:28.531Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 31 Oct 2026 13:46:28 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;RSF forces have launched drone strikes on a Darfur market, killing over 100 civilians and damaging a power station that cut electricity to two states. The Sudanese army is accused of carrying out 162 drone attacks from Ethiopian territory, a claim Ethiopia denies. A senior RSF commander has defected from Hemedti's forces, accusing the group’s leadership of nepotism, while an investigation has mapped commanders linked to wartime rape. The UAE federal court sentenced eight people to life imprisonment for illegal arms supplies to Sudan’s army. There were 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168703&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuAFBVV95cUxQOGo1SDRqeG5MUXZGOTluOFlURkxhcEtRUjZ4emR4NmNmQW1yajFVaFhRamlzRl9rcTZfZnhzOGVkTEJhQWN0cGdJUjhiQWZSY3JKelhQbDNMenByVktGZFVqWmI5XzJsTzhYZmhBa3RYaS1LZzRmYUdVd2pFLXJNVC14YW5YUjllSlcxNzk2d0s5Y05VbmlGcXNZSWRQM1RrM2diSWdVLXVma21zaFJRLWMzV0p1dG5z0gG-AUFVX3lxTFBFNHduWUhLZXFYSmRHLTFDdm00Z0xEMHdua0EwMmtPemIwSi1ScGhrUjhpcGU4QTBNeXNEaktNek05ZTBZZ1VPMUpheGIxUGZYMmdHT3FXbXhTN245bURaMlE4aDhRNzJxMEVjcUZ5eFQ5WnRvbi02OFFWTnR3UVdkdXNGMFBYS0VMQkhXcmwzX1d2YmZKRVVjOVBUbkFkRnF5Wl9qbC1lR3MybDZ3MkVxRGJDVzBuVEI0Z1FHd0E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxNMXJ4b1B3NnRNb2dQT2dvUFNkQmNJVHAtMUJJSVU0UEVDMWt2UWN6aFRoODMwSmtKNGJ4TlM2dzhCNXZaTmdWSVltRjI0MlEtSXdsZTJxd0k0M1JMRUFJLTU0UlBNSDJtdWtjRTRGWTZ6cmc3NkFuaHdTSml